    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but resting doesn't change the fact that the road is gone. it's not like a pause in the weather, it's like the actual earth just ended. i look out and there's nothing to see, no more scenery, no more direction. it feels like reaching the end of a book where the last page is just blank. there's no point in standing here waiting for a path to reappear when the map says this is where it all stops. it just feels... final.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
