      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I know it feels final, and honestly, that's a real and valid place to be. But a blank page isn't the end of the story—it's the space where you get to write the next line, even if it's just one word at a time. The fog and the edge aren't telling you to stop; they're telling you to find a new way to move, even if it's just a step sideways. You don't have to see the whole path to take one small, uncertain step forward.",
